  "html": "<section class=\"container section--services-hero pt-5\">\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__left\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group h-align icon-plus-title is-layout-flex wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">    <div class=\"iconblock wp-elements-1 has-background has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-secondary-inverse-color\" data-size=\"md\" data-padding=\"2\" data-display=\"inline\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-generator\" /></svg>    </div>\n\n<h1 class=\"has-link-color wp-elements-2 wp-block-post-title has-text-color has-secondary-color has-x-large-font-size\">Home Generators in Greenville, SC</h1></div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group services-hero-description flow is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<p>Whole house standby generators sized, installed, and serviced for homes throughout Greenville, SC.</p>\n<p>A standby generator is the difference between an outage being a news item and being a problem in your house, and Carolina Heating Service sizes, installs, and services home generators throughout Greenville, SC and the Upstate. This page covers the equipment itself: how standby generators work, how sizing decisions get made, and what the ownership experience involves.</p>\n<p>Upstate outages come from summer thunderstorms, winter ice, and the occasional tropical remnant that tracks inland, and each one arrives without an appointment. A standby generator answers all three the same way, automatically and within seconds.</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"wp-block-group mb-3 full-width-mobile schedule-and-call-cta is-content-justification-left is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-a1b15d37 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group schedule-cta-container is-vertical is-content-justification-stretch is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-41171c72 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<a href=\"/bookings\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta se-widget-button\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-event\" /></svg><span >Schedule Now</span>\n\n</a>\n\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-bottom: -4px;\"></div>\n\n<a href=\"tel:+18643626329\" aria-label=\"Call now: +18643626329\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta phone-link\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span data-show-on=\"desktop\">(864) 362-6329</span>\n        <span data-show-on=\"mobile\">Call Now</span>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"has-primary-color has-text-color has-link-color has-secondary-font-family has-small-font-size text-center wp-elements-3 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\"><strong>Same Day Appointments Available by Phone</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><!-- ./left -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__right\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-block-post-featured-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1916\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/images/2024/03/A-Generac-generator-unit.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"A Generac Home Generator Unit installed at a Residence in Greenville, SC\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" /></figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\t\t\t</div><!-- ./right -->\n\t\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</div>\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main section--services-hero__main--empty has-background has-secondary-background-color\"></div>\n\n</section>\n<!-- container /--><div id=\"types-of-services\" class=\"types-of-service-container container py-5 wp-elements-4 has-custom-acf-color has-background has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-primary-inverse-color\"><!-- wp-block-columns/ -->\n        <div data-num-of-columns=\"3\" class=\"wp-block-columns mb-4 is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-layout-1 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n    <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-toolbox\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">Standby Generator Inspections &amp; Repairs</h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <p>At Carolina Heating Service, our certified technicians specialize in comprehensive inspection and repair services for standby generators. Whether you require routine maintenance or emergency repairs, we ensure your generator operates at peak efficiency, providing reliable power to your home when you need it most. Serving Greenville, SC, and the surrounding areas, our team is dedicated to delivering prompt, reliable service that guarantees your comfort and peace of mind during unexpected outages. Trust Carolina Heating Service for all your standby generator needs and keep your home powered in every situation.</p>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-installation\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">Standby Generator Installations</h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <p>Upgrade your home’s reliability and safety with Carolina Heating Service’s expert standby generator installation services. Our experienced team specializes in installing high-performance generators tailored to your home&#8217;s specific needs. Whether you&#8217;re replacing an outdated unit or installing a new one for the first time, we ensure a seamless process with minimal disruption. Serving Greenville, SC, and surrounding areas, Carolina Heating Service is committed to providing top-quality installation services that deliver long-term reliability and peace of mind. Trust us to enhance your home’s backup power capabilities for years to come.</p>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-maintenance\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">Standby Generator Maintenance</h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <p>Ensure your standby generator remains in top working condition with Carolina Heating Service’s comprehensive maintenance services. Our expert technicians focus on optimizing the performance of your generator, helping you avoid costly repairs and unexpected power failures. Regular maintenance is key to maximizing efficiency, extending the lifespan of your unit, and ensuring reliable operation during outages. Serving Greenville, SC, and surrounding areas, we tailor our maintenance plans to your specific needs, offering peace of mind and unmatched reliability for your home. Trust Carolina Heating Service to keep your standby generator running smoothly and efficiently all year long.</p>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        </div><!-- ./ wp-block-columns --> </div><!-- ./container -->\n<div class=\"our-promise container \" id=\"our-promise\">\n<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\">\n\n<figure class=\"our-promise__photo\">\n<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"/images/2024/03/Two-Carolina-Heating-Service-technicians-installing-a-generator.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"Two Carolina Heating Service technicians installing a generator\" /></figure>\n<div class=\"our-promise__info\">\n    <p class=\"h3 our-promise__info__headline\">Home Generator Services for Greenville and the Surrounding Upstate Region</p>\n    <div class=\"our-promise__info__description\">At Carolina Heating Service, our technicians deliver top-quality installations and are dedicated to ensuring your complete satisfaction. When it comes to power backup solutions, you can trust us to provide reliable installations that keep your home powered during outages. We offer exceptional service, utilizing the latest technology and best practices to guarantee that your backup systems operate seamlessly when you need them most. Our commitment to quality and customer care means you can enjoy peace of mind knowing that your power needs are in expert hands. Choose Carolina Heating Service for all your power backup solutions and experience the difference of working with a trusted team!</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div  class=\"container splitter makes-and-models has-background has-white-background-color\" style=\"--CTX-container-split-size: 0.5\">\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--left splitter-column--center\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner splitter-column-inner--contained splitter-column-inner--padded\">\n\n        <div class=\"wp-block-group flow has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n\n<div  class=\"logogrid\" style=\"--count: 15;\">\n    <ul role=\"list\" class=\"logocarousel-list\" style=\"--logo-count:15;\">\n            <li class=\"logogrid-item\">\n            <div class=\"logogrid-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"167\" src=\"/images/2024/02/amana-vector-logo.png\" class=\"logogrid-image\" alt=\"Amana Heating &amp; Air Conditioning Logo\" /></div>        </li>\n            <li class=\"logogrid-item\">\n            <div class=\"logogrid-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"/images/2024/02/ruud-3d-square.png\" class=\"logogrid-image\" alt=\"Ruud logo\" /></div>        </li>\n            <li class=\"logogrid-item\">\n            <div class=\"logogrid-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"80\" src=\"/images/2024/02/goodman-ac-1-logo.png\" class=\"logogrid-image\" alt=\"Goodman logo\" /></div>        </li>\n            <li class=\"logogrid-item\">\n            <div class=\"logogrid-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"123\" src=\"/images/2024/02/american-standard.png\" class=\"logogrid-image\" alt=\"American Standard logo\" /></div>        </li>\n            <li class=\"logogrid-item\">\n            <div class=\"logogrid-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"121\" src=\"/images/2024/02/Logo_of_the_Carrier_Corporation.svg.png\" class=\"logogrid-image\" alt=\"Carrier Logo\" /></div>        </li>\n            <li class=\"logogrid-item\">\n            <div class=\"logogrid-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" wid