ght=\"57\" src=\"/images/2024/03/Water-Furnace-logo.png\" class=\"logogrid-image\" alt=\"Water Furnace logo\" /></div>        </li>\n            <li class=\"logogrid-item\">\n            <div class=\"logogrid-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"154\" src=\"/images/2024/02/Generac_Sales_Service_Logo10400553.jpeg\" class=\"logogrid-image\" alt=\"Generac Sales &amp; Service Dealer\" /></div>        </li>\n        </ul>\n</div>\n\n            <h6 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\">\n                And Dozens More\n            </h6></div>\n\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--right splitter-column--center py-3 has-custom-acf-color has-background has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-secondary-inverse-color wp-elements-5\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner splitter-column-inner--contained splitter-column-inner--padded\">\n\n    <h2 class=\"wp-block-heading mb-3\">Qualified for All Major Makes and Models</h2>\n\n    <div class=\"wp-block-group flow mb-2 has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n    <p>Our team of expert technicians is trained to handle all makes and models of major brands with precision and care. From routine maintenance to complex repairs, we ensure top-notch service for all.</p>\n\n    </div>\n\n<div  class=\"iconlist\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-iconsize=\"md\">\n    <ul role=\"list\">\n                <li class=\"iconlist-item\">\n            <svg class=\"icon iconlist-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-check\" /></svg>            <div class=\"iconlist-text\">\n                <p class=\"iconlist-label\"></p>\n                <p class=\"iconlist-description\"><p>Ensure optimal efficiency of all your systems</p>\n</p>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n                <li class=\"iconlist-item\">\n            <svg class=\"icon iconlist-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-check\" /></svg>            <div class=\"iconlist-text\">\n                <p class=\"iconlist-label\"></p>\n                <p class=\"iconlist-description\"><p>Lower your utility costs with energy efficiency</p>\n</p>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n                <li class=\"iconlist-item\">\n            <svg class=\"icon iconlist-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-check\" /></svg>            <div class=\"iconlist-text\">\n                <p class=\"iconlist-label\"></p>\n                <p class=\"iconlist-description\"><p>Extend your system’s lifespan through regular maintenance</p>\n</p>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n                <li class=\"iconlist-item\">\n            <svg class=\"icon iconlist-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-check\" /></svg>            <div class=\"iconlist-text\">\n                <p class=\"iconlist-label\"></p>\n                <p class=\"iconlist-description\"><p>Keep you and your family comfortable and safe during all seasons</p>\n</p>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n            </ul>\n</div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n</div><div id=\"our-certifications\" class=\"container certifications-and-awards py-5\">\n    <h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center mb-4 d-inline-block h-decorator h-decorator--primary\">Our Certifications & Awards</h2>\n<div  class=\"logocarousel\" style=\"--count: 5;\" data-logo-count=\"5\">\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"button-reset | logocarousel-arrow logocarousel-arrow--start\" aria-label=\"See previous\"><svg class=\"logocarousel-arrow-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronleft\" /></svg></button>\n    <div class=\"logocarousel--inner-container\">\n        <ul role=\"list\" class=\"logocarousel-list\" style=\"--logo-count:5;\">\n                                <li class=\"logocarousel-item\">\n                        <div class=\"logocarousel-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"113\" src=\"/images/2024/03/Better-Business-Bureau-Accredited-Business.png\" class=\"logocarousel-image\" alt=\"Better Business Bureau - Accredited Business\" /></div>                    </li>\n                                    <li class=\"logocarousel-item\">\n                        <div class=\"logocarousel-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"232\" src=\"/images/2024/03/Esco-Institute-logo.png\" class=\"logocarousel-image\" alt=\"Esco Institute logo\" /></div>                    </li>\n                                    <li class=\"logocarousel-item\">\n                        <div class=\"logocarousel-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"252\" height=\"250\" src=\"/images/2024/03/North-American-Technician-Excellence-logo-NATE.png\" class=\"logocarousel-image\" alt=\"North American Technician Excellence logo (NATE)\" /></div>                    </li>\n                                    <li class=\"logocarousel-item\">\n                        <div class=\"logocarousel-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"120\" src=\"/images/2024/03/SCALT-logo.png\" class=\"logocarousel-image\" alt=\"SCALT logo\" /></div>                    </li>\n                                    <li class=\"logocarousel-item\">\n                        <div class=\"logocarousel-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"192\" src=\"/images/2024/03/SHA-logo.jpg\" class=\"logocarousel-image\" alt=\"SHA logo\" /></div>                    </li>\n                                    <li class=\"logocarousel-item logocarousel-item--clone\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-logocarousel-item=\"4898\">\n                        <div class=\"logocarousel-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"113\" src=\"/images/2024/03/Better-Business-Bureau-Accredited-Business.png\" class=\"logocarousel-image\" alt=\"Better Business Bureau - Accredited Business\" /></div>                    </li>\n                                    <li class=\"logocarousel-item logocarousel-item--clone\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-logocarousel-item=\"4899\">\n                        <div class=\"logocarousel-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"232\" src=\"/images/2024/03/Esco-Institute-logo.png\" class=\"logocarousel-image\" alt=\"Esco Institute logo\" /></div>                    </li>\n                                    <li class=\"logocarousel-item logocarousel-item--clone\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-logocarousel-item=\"4900\">\n                        <div class=\"logocarousel-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"252\" height=\"250\" src=\"/images/2024/03/North-American-Technician-Excellence-logo-NATE.png\" class=\"logocarousel-image\" alt=\"North American Technician Excellence logo (NATE)\" /></div>                    </li>\n                                    <li class=\"logocarousel-item logocarousel-item--clone\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-logocarousel-item=\"4901\">\n                        <div class=\"logocarousel-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"120\" src=\"/images/2024/03/SCALT-logo.png\" class=\"logocarousel-image\" alt=\"SCALT logo\" /></div>                    </li>\n                                    <li class=\"logocarousel-item logocarousel-item--clone\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-logocarousel-item=\"4902\">\n                        <div class=\"logocarousel-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"192\" src=\"/images/2024/03/SHA-logo.jpg\" class=\"logocarousel-image\" alt=\"SHA logo\" /></div>                    </li>\n                                    <li class=\"logocarousel-item logocarousel-item--clone\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-logocarousel-item=\"4898\">\n                        <div class=\"logocarousel-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"113\" src=\"/images/2024/03/Better-Business-Bureau-Accredited-Business.png\" class=\"logocarousel-image\" alt=\"Better Business Bureau - Accredited Business\" /></div>                    </li>\n                                    <li class=\"logocarousel-item logocarousel-item--clone\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-logocarousel-item=\"4899\">\n                        <div class=\"logocarousel-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"232\" src=\"/images/2024/03/Esco-Institute-logo.png\" class=\"logocarousel-image\" alt=\"Esco Institute logo\" /></div>                    </li>\n                                    <li class=\"logocarousel-item logocarousel-item--clone\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-logocarousel-item=\"4900\">\n                        <div class=\"logocarousel-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"252\" height=\"250\" src=\"/images/2024/03/North-American-Technician-Excellence-logo-NATE.png\" class=\"logocarousel-image\" alt=\"North American Technician Excellence logo (NATE)\" /></div>                    </li>\n                                    <li class=\"logocarousel-item logocarousel-item--clone\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-logocarousel-item=\"4901\">\n                        <div class=\"logocarousel-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"120\" src=\"/images/2024/03/SCALT-logo.png\" class=\"logocarousel-image\" alt=\"SCALT logo\" /></div>                    </li>\n                                    <li class=\"logocarousel-item logocarousel-item--clone\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-logocarousel-item=\"4902\">\n                        <div class=\"logocarousel-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"192\" src=\"/images/2024/03/SHA-logo.jpg\" class=\"logocarousel-image\" alt=\"SHA logo\" /></div>                    </li>\n                        </ul>\n    </div>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"button-reset | logocarousel-arrow logocarousel-arrow--end\" aria-label=\"See next\"><svg class=\"logocarousel-arrow-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg></button>\n</div></div>\n\n<div id=\"FAQs\" class=\"wp-block-group py-5 flow has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">FAQs</h2>\n\n<div  class=\"accordion\" style=\"--_accordion-separator-color: \">\n            <details class=\"accordion-item\" data-custom-open=\"true\" open>\n            <summary class=\"accordion-title | paired-icon-text\">\n                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--closed | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevrondown\" /></svg>                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--open | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronup\" /></svg>                <p class=\"paired-text\">How fast does a standby generator restore power?</p>\n            </summary>\n\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"accordion-content-inner\">\n                    <p>Most standby units restore power within about 10 to 30 seconds of an outage. The transfer switch handles the changeover automatically, so the system works the same whether you are home or away.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </details>            <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <summary class=\"accordion-title | paired-icon-text\">\n                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--closed | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevrondown\" /></svg>                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--open | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronup\" /></svg>                <p class=\"paired-text\">Natural gas or propane for the generator?</p>\n            </summary>\n\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"accordion-content-inner\">\n                    <p>Homes with natural gas service almost always use it, since the fuel supply is continuous and there is no tank to fill. Homes without gas service run on propane, where tank size determines runtime and becomes part of the sizing conversation.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </details>            <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <summary class=\"accordion-title | paired-icon-text\">\n                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--closed | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevrondown\" /></svg>                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--open | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronup\" /></svg>                <p class=\"paired-text\">How much maintenance does a standby generator need?</p>\n            </summary>\n\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"accordion-content-inner\">\n                    <p>An annual service covering oil, filters, battery, and a load test, plus attention to the unit&#8217;s automatic weekly self-test. A generator that skips maintenance tends to reveal it during the outage it was bought for, which is the one test that counts.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </details>            <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <summary class=\"accordion-title | paired-icon-text\">\n                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--closed | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevrondown\" /></svg>                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--open | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronup\" /></svg>                <p class=\"paired-text\">Will a standby generator run my central air conditioning?</p>\n            </summary>\n\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"accordion-content-inner\">\n                    <p>Yes, if it is sized for the compressor&#8217;s startup demand. This is the single load that most often separates an adequate generator from an undersized one, and it is exactly what the load calculation exists to capture.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </details>            <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <summary class=\"accordion-title | paired-icon-text\">\n                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--closed | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevrondown\" /></svg>                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--open | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronup\" /></svg>                <p class=\"paired-text\">How long can a standby generator run continuously?</p>\n            </summary>\n\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"accordion-content-inner\">\n                    <p>On natural gas, through multi-day outages, with manufacturers recommending periodic shutdowns for oil checks during extended runs. On propane, runtime is set by tank capacity, and the technician can model it from your expected load.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </details>    </div>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"maintenance-financing\" class=\"container splitter splitter--uniform-height-stick-last\" style=\"--CTX-container-split-size: 0.5\">\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--left splitter-column--start has-background has-primary-background-color\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner splitter-column-inner--contained splitter-column-inner--padded\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow w100 has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-2468f3b8 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\"><div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile w100 border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized has-custom-border w100\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1916\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/images/2024/03/A-Carolina-Heating-Service-technician-performing-maintenance.jpg\" alt=\"A Carolina Heating Service technician performing maintenance\" class=\"wp-image-4845\" style=\"border-radius:0px;width:288px;height:auto\" /></figure>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading mt-3 has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-6\">Need a Maintenance Plan?</h2>\n\n<p class=\"has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-7 wp-block-paragraph\">What You Receive With the Carolina Comfort Club:</p>\n\n<ul class=\"has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-block-list wp-elements-8\">\n<li>15% Off Repair</li>\n\n<li>Heating &amp; Cooling Tune-Up</li>\n\n<li>Reduced Dispatch Fees</li>\n\n<li>Priority Service</li>\n\n<li>Save More with Loyalty Points</li>\n</ul>\n\n<a href=\"/maintenance\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outline\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta full-width-mobile\">\n    <span >Learn More</span>\n        <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>\n</a></div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--right splitter-column--start has-background has-primary-inverse-background-color\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner splitter-column-inner--contained splitter-column-inner--padded\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\"><div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full has-custom-border\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1802\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/images/2024/03/A-Carolina-Heating-Service-employee-smiling-while-sitting-at-a-desk-and-working-on-their-computer.jpg\" alt=\"A Carolina Heating Service employee smiling while sitting at a desk and working on their computer\" class=\"wp-image-4837\" style=\"border-radius:0px\" /></figure>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading mt-3\">Ask Us About Financing!</h2>\n\n<p class=\"mb-3 wp-block-paragraph\">Financing plans bring value and benefits to homeowners. By opting for a financing option, you can tackle necessary repairs or upgrades without draining your savings or delaying important projects. Here are some key advantages:</p>\n\n<ul class=\"my-0 mb-0 wp-block-list\">\n<li>Budget-Friendly</li>\n\n<li>Access to Quality Services</li>\n\n<li>Timely Repairs</li>\n\n<li>Flexibility</li>\n\n<li>Increase Home Value</li>\n\n<li>Emergency Protection</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p class=\"mt-3 wp-block-paragraph\">Keep your home safe and comfortable with a finance plan. Always assess terms and interest rates to find the best one for your needs. A professional can help you make an informed decision.</p>\n\n<a href=\"/financing\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta full-width-mobile\">\n    <span >Learn More</span>\n        <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>\n</a></div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>        <div id=\"reviews\" class=\"google-reviews-featured container container py-5 has-background has-gray-light-background-color\">\n    <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head\">\n        <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__logo\">            <svg version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" x=\"0px\" y=\"0px\" viewBox=\"0 0 107.3 35.2\" style=\"enable-background:new 0 0 1