tars\">\n                <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__rating__stars__black\">★★★★★</div>\n                <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__rating__stars__white\">☆☆☆☆☆</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__rating__score\">\n                5/5\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__rating__number-of-reviews\">\n                <span>18 Reviews</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n        <!-- reviews body -->\n    <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__body\">\n                                                <!-- review carousel -->\n                <div class=\"nearu-carousel multi-component-container multi-component-container--uniform-height\">                    <div  class=\"card card--google-review has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Todd Hester\" aria-label=\"Todd Hester\">Todd Hester</p>\n            <div class=\"card__content__title__stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\">\n<p>Fantastic service on our backup generator following a mechanical failure in the aftermath of Hurricane Helene. From my first phone call to request service until the job was successfully completed, I could not have asked for a better experience. Our technician arrived with the part we needed which had been stocked on his service vehicle. Our sincere thanks to everyone at Carolina Heating Service for the rapid response and a job well done!</p>\n</div>\n\n                </div></div>\n                            <div  class=\"card card--google-review has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Bob Hiles\" aria-label=\"Bob Hiles\">Bob Hiles</p>\n            <div class=\"card__content__title__stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\">\n<p>After having electrical problems with our Generac generator, Carolina Power sent Guilherme out to find the problem. This man is definitely a pro!! After testing and inspecting the system, he found the problem. He repaired it right away and ran it multiple times. It finally works great. Thank you Guilherme - GREAT JOB!!</p>\n</div>\n\n                </div></div>\n                            <div  class=\"card card--google-review has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Edgar Casner\" aria-label=\"Edgar Casner\">Edgar Casner</p>\n            <div class=\"card__content__title__stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\">\n<p>Carolina and Heating came to our aid during the fallout of hurricane Helene. They came checked on our generator next day with all of the power out. Connor did amazing job and was patient, professional, and polite while making sure our generator was fully functional and operational! Thank you Carolina and Heating!</p>\n</div>\n\n                </div></div>\n            </div>\n    <!-- ./ review carousel -->\n    <div class=\"nearu-carousel-controls\">\n\t<div class=\"nearu-carousel-button button-prev\">    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"2\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronleft\" /></svg>    </div>\n    </div>\n\t<div class=\"carousel-dots\"><div role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 1 of 3\" data-nearu-carousel-dot-index=\"1\" class=\"carousel-dots__dot selected\"></div><div role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 2 of 3\" data-nearu-carousel-dot-index=\"2\" class=\"carousel-dots__dot\"></div><div role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 3 of 3\" data-nearu-carousel-dot-index=\"3\" class=\"carousel-dots__dot\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"nearu-carousel-button button-next\">    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"2\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>    </div>\n    </div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- ./ reviews body -->\n\n</div>\n<div id=\"our-community\" class=\"container splitter mobile-flip-splitter has-background has-white-background-color\" style=\"--CTX-container-split-size: 0.5\">\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--left splitter-column--center splitter-column--padded-edge\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner splitter-column-inner--contained splitter-column-inner--padded\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\"><div class=\"wp-block-site-logo\"><a href=\"/\" class=\"custom-logo-link\" rel=\"home\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"122\" src=\"/images/2024/08/Carolina-Heating_Logo-NearU-1-1.png\" class=\"custom-logo\" alt=\"Carolina Heating Service Logo\" /></a></div>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading h-decorator h-decorator--primary has-secondary-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-9\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:600\">Serving the communities in Greenville, South Carolina, for over 40 Years.</h2>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Carolina Heating Service is known for reputable home comfort services throughout the Greenville, SC area. With a history dating back to 1981, our expertise initially focused on heating and air conditioning. Over time, we expanded to include plumbing, electrical, drains, generators, and indoor air quality systems. Our continued commitment to exceptional service and highly trained technicians reflects our dedication to customer satisfaction throughout the Upstate.</p>\n\n<div  class=\"wp-block-group mb-3 full-width-mobile schedule-and-call-cta is-content-justification-left is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-a1b15d37 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group schedule-cta-container is-vertical is-content-justification-stretch is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-41171c72 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<a href=\"/bookings\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta se-widget-button\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-event\" /></svg><span >Schedule Now</span>\n\n</a>\n\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-bottom: -4px;\"></div>\n\n<a href=\"tel:+18643626329\" aria-label=\"Call now: +18643626329\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta phone-link\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span data-show-on=\"desktop\">(864) 362-6329</span>\n        <span data-show-on=\"mobile\">Call Now</span>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"has-primary-color has-text-color has-link-color has-secondary-font-family has-small-font-size text-center wp-elements-10 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\"><strong>Same Day Appointments Available by Phone</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--right splitter-column--stretch\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner\">\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1818\" src=\"/images/2024/03/CHS-Service-Area-Map-Highlighted-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"CHS Service Area Map Highlighted\" class=\"wp-image-4911\" /></figure>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>"
